   "id": "naga-thumb-grid",
   "name": "Naga thumb grid",
   "style": "MMO mouse",
   "summary": "Everything you press every pull sits on the six side buttons; Shift + side button is the heal and protection layer. The keyboard keeps Seals, utility and panic buttons.",
   "approach": [
    "Core rotation and flex talents on the thumb (side buttons 1–6).",
    "Shift + thumb = second bar: mouseover heals, Cleanse, BoP, Freedom.",
    "Seals on 1–5 so swapping a Seal never moves your thumb.",
    "Set the Naga to send keys WoW can take modifiers on (Synapse: F13–F18 or Ctrl+Numpad), as forum users recommend."
   ],
