   "id": "wheel-click-healer",
   "name": "Wheel & click healer",
   "style": "Healer-first",
   "summary": "Heals ride the mouse wheel and wheel click while you hover party frames, the way click-casting (Clique) healers work. Melee stays on 1–4 so Protection and Retribution still feel normal.",
   "approach": [
    "Wheel up = Flash of Light, wheel down = Holy Light, wheel click = Cleanse, all mouseover.",
    "Shift + wheel = Blessing of Protection, Lay on Hands, Freedom.",
    "Talent buttons on the thumb (side 1–3) so Holy Shock and Light's Vigil sit beside the heals.",
    "Left/right click stay free for targeting and camera (this planner can't bind them; with Clique you could)."
   ],
