   "id": "keyboard-wasd",
   "name": "Keyboard-first WASD",
   "style": "Keyboard only",
   "summary": "The classic YouTube and guide-site layout: every combat button on 1–6 and the letters around WASD, with Shift as the second layer. The mouse is only for the wheel, so it works with any mouse.",
   "approach": [
    "Most-pressed abilities closest to your movement fingers (1–4, Q, E, R, F).",
    "Interrupt-style buttons (Hammer of Justice) kept within easy reach, not on far keys like V or B.",
    "Shift = related variant of the same key; Ctrl/Alt for auras, blessings and out-of-combat.",
    "Turn with the mouse so A/D strafe and your left hand never leaves the cluster."
